                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">“中美青年大使项目”（<FONT face=Calibri>Sino-American Youth Ambassadors Program</FONT><FONT face=宋体>）是为积极响应中美两国领导人号召，在美国安生文教交流基金会在中美相关教育部门和教学机构的支持下，于</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2009<FONT face=宋体>年</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>创设，以促进和加深两国人民、特别是两国青年之间的了解和互信的教育文化交流。目前已持续了八届。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>一、项目特色和优势</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1<FONT face=宋体>．高端性：中美两国元首的赞誉、肯定，承载国家的利益和寄托；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2.  <FONT face=宋体>高认可：由于中美两国元首的赞誉和肯定，特别是美国总统的赞誉使得美国教育界特别是美国大学界对项目给予高度信任和认可，大大增加了“青年大使”参与者及此履历的光环和荣誉；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">3.  <FONT face=宋体>高要求：遴选上的“青年大使”学生，需品学兼优、英文听说优秀，有组织和活动能力，具有才艺性；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">4.  <FONT face=宋体>高展现：展现“青年大使”的组织能力：组织美国学生参加活动；展现“青年大使”的创新能力：自我设计、自我筹划在美国开展的活动；展现演讲能力；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">5.  <FONT face=宋体>高收获：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">“理论<FONT face=Calibri>-</FONT><FONT face=宋体>实践</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>-</FONT><FONT face=宋体>理论”</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>/</FONT><FONT face=宋体>“书本</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>-</FONT><FONT face=宋体>实际</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>-</FONT><FONT face=宋体>书本”的收获：安生组织的出国前关于美国政治、金融、文化、历史和教育的系列讲座和课程，出国后实地的观摩、领略、访谈和学习，回国后的总结、宣讲和文章发表；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>个人信心和能力的收获：成功的组织美国学生参加由</FONT>“青年大使”设计的活动，是最有说服力的信心和能力的证明；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">6.  <FONT face=宋体>高含金量：高层次的、极具特色和信服力的海外社会实践经历、多元文化体验过程和个人能力展示手段，最终的由安生文教基金会、美国学校、美国教育行政部门认证授予的“青年大使”证书将使“青年大使”无可非议的从万众学子中脱颖而出，被美国大学、社会所称誉和高度认可。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>二、活动时间：</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2017<FONT face=宋体>年寒假，共二周，赴美学习交流。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>三、活动内容：</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>第一周</FONT> <FONT face=宋体>在全美经过选拔的美国学校进行活动。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=楷体>与美国学生共同进入正常课堂，聆听和观察美国的教育和教学方式，领略不同的教学模式，对中美教育教学进行比较；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=楷体>组织美国学生参加中国学生在校园安排和实施的中华文化推广和交流活动，创设</FONT>“中国文化周”。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=楷体>开展中美学生合作性学术课题研究，进行中美精英学生全方位对话，相互切磋，共同进步，智慧火花的碰撞，全面提升学术能力，增进国际多元文化理解。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>第二周</FONT> <FONT face=宋体>赴各地参观访问，多方位地了解美国的政治、金融、文化、历史和教育。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=楷体>参观访问美国首都华盛顿，深度了解美国政治和社会结构；</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
